      "writtenOn": "2023-05-09T03:52:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to Temporal Locality and Spatial Locality, if a pte is not present, There is a high probability that the surrounding page table entries is also not present and be read in the subsequent instructions. We want to do more in the page fault handle processure. However, userspace program can not read page tables. By doing handling the relevant page table entries, we expire the number of page fault could be reduced much. Besides, readahead operation\u0027s granularity by userspace madvise are too coarse for us, readahead operations in the ko can be much more accurately.",
      "parentUuid": "c8f7c7c3_fa4462b3",
      "revId": "c642e2db80ffd98e60f47adece8adcfa505cdde3",
